{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/b926eb5a2a618a120d81df30e6a1de54.poster.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/b926eb5a2a618a120d81df30e6a1de54.webm?t=1755275544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/7a0e035c9ced813b7a67f9436503855f.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa loves the laid-back life in countryside villages so much that she even took agriculture classes in college. When she heard that there's a new program to repopulate a village that will provide those who come with some land, she immediately jumped at the opportunity. Her friend Honoka even decided to join her to keep her company! Join them as they plant crops, raise animals, interact with the villagers, and grow their little slice of village life into something to be proud of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/6c9bd7f8bc57281fa22d043b1745dbb8.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lisa, a farming enthusiast in a soothing adventure, where you raise your own farm, including various vegetation, fungiculture, raising animals, and even catching fishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft and upgrade your tools, gather ingredients to cook delicious meals, and go fishing at the lake! Explore the village and interact with villagers, who might even help you with the farm. And when everything is done for the day, your cute girlfriend just might have a reward for you~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/af93a37bb87af2bcabf7a9fcd5e26f2a.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/39f2c954233cb09f52cd060b7461b9c9.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/2518d056a02dc49d964f53b20a7765ed.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/779e253227eb7d95ce164a208bca64f9.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hoard of items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of items to collect, including (but certainly not limited to) vegetables, fruits, minerals, fishes, mushrooms, and even animals!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers three different modes for different types of players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cheater (Easy mode)<br>- Casual (Normal mode)<br>- Slow Grind (Farming veterans)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be your own designer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, build, and design your very own mega farm! The game allows you to design the farm area, including building animal sheds and customizing the farmland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/0e1862316f4980e5086f5603bf76893c5044fe05.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/bf78c36930488a95f30b4aba5e60d1dd11c80aee.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/ec55432b2b49f78d4e9c362d9d58189774ee0ce6.jpg"},{"name":"Peaceful Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/7d6ca819aa8697fdb31fea07d6118e4c16909b79.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/d14ff2ac1d134b59b9234c95b8c7bd679654afe4.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/cfb94b5f7d433fa480c91a6005812c341cfee02d.jpg"},{"name":"Everyday Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/259eb3cbdb1b4b0a5690cce9492b347e07a254a3.jpg"},{"name":"Charismatic Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/70c58b5d68df79214c789d56e0b4b01c5aef5f84.jpg"},{"name":"Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/1a7970bdf44acd27c3a51c639b9f5122b2f8ba0a.jpg"},{"name":"Slow Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3442040/d816534d5d1d48568547497a837ae69ea03dcdcf.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442040?t=1755275544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755275544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/203160597aa028d13c53b5da4d96e3e15080f769/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755275544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/203160597aa028d13c53b5da4d96e3e15080f769/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755275544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3475460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/b926eb5a2a618a120d81df30e6a1de54.poster.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/b926eb5a2a618a120d81df30e6a1de54.webm?t=1755275544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/7a0e035c9ced813b7a67f9436503855f.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lisa loves the laid-back life in countryside villages so much that she even took agriculture classes in college. When she heard that there's a new program to repopulate a village that will provide those who come with some land, she immediately jumped at the opportunity. Her friend Honoka even decided to join her to keep her company! Join them as they plant crops, raise animals, interact with the villagers, and grow their little slice of village life into something to be proud of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/6c9bd7f8bc57281fa22d043b1745dbb8.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lisa, a farming enthusiast in a soothing adventure, where you raise your own farm, including various vegetation, fungiculture, raising animals, and even catching fishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft and upgrade your tools, gather ingredients to cook delicious meals, and go fishing at the lake! Explore the village and interact with villagers, who might even help you with the farm. And when everything is done for the day, your cute girlfriend just might have a reward for you~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/af93a37bb87af2bcabf7a9fcd5e26f2a.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/39f2c954233cb09f52cd060b7461b9c9.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/2518d056a02dc49d964f53b20a7765ed.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/extras/779e253227eb7d95ce164a208bca64f9.avif?t=1755275544\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hoard of items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of items to collect, including (but certainly not limited to) vegetables, fruits, minerals, fishes, mushrooms, and even animals!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers three different modes for different types of players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cheater (Easy mode)<br>- Casual (Normal mode)<br>- Slow Grind (Farming veterans)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be your own designer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, build, and design your very own mega farm! The game allows you to design the farm area, including building animal sheds and customizing the farmland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Minaduki Cafe"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442040/header.jpg?t=1755275544","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3442040/812286/6ec7434ffff339076866edf9cba41bbcc22d412d/1750851378/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739428145","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3442040/812286/6ec7434ffff339076866edf9cba41bbcc22d412d/1750851378/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739428145","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3442040/812286/6ec7434ffff339076866edf9cba41bbcc22d412d/1750851378/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739428145","id":257088780,"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088780/65d9987e7a568eb1e5b0f5994b11526fb70a90ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739428145"}],"name":"Dream Life in the Country Side","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Dream Life in the Country Side - <span class=\"disco